        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BSE100TEKSAL, 1\" Square Teak Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUnique is definitely a word to describe this Square Teak Door Pull. The modern shape paired with the natural wood makes for a stunning combination. The door pull is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. The square mounts can be finished in a huge selection of colors. This 1 Inch Square Wood Door Handle can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Modern Teak Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Teak</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BSE02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262337\"><b>First ImpressionsBSE100TEKSAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BSE100012TEKSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BSE100024TEKSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BSE100036TEKSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Square Teak Door Pull",
                "description": "Unique is definitely a word to describe this Square Teak Door Pull. The modern shape paired with the natural wood makes for a stunning combination. The door pull is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. The square mounts can be finished in a huge selection of colors. This 1 Inch Square Wood Door Handle can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted.",
